content:
Ɗaukar da aka yi musu bisa ga iyalai yana kamar haka.

    Daga Yahuda, shugaban ƙungiya 1,000.
    Adna ne shugaba, tare da jarumawa 300,000;

Ginshiƙai biyu;
    kwanoni biyu masu siffar kwartaniya a bisa ginshiƙai;
    jeri biyu na tuƙaƙƙen adon kwanonin yayyafawa masu siffar kwartaniya a bisa ginshiƙai;

Solomon ya kuma yi dukan kayayyakin da suke a cikin haikalin Allah.

    Bagaden zinariya;
    teburin da ake ajiye burodin Kasancewa;
